sequenceDiagram
  participant C as client
  participant GW as gateway
  participant OR as orders
  C->>GW: POST orders with bearer token
  alt no or invalid token
    GW-->>C: 401
  else valid
    GW->>OR: POST orders body plus customer id
    OR-->>GW: 201 order
    GW-->>C: upstream status and body
  end
